<title>USA: Applied Computer Tech Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Applied Computer Tech Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>FORT COLLINS, Colo. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Computer Technology Inc</p>
<p>			   Three Months ended  Nine Months ended</p>
<p>			     September 30th:  September 30th:</p>
<p>			    1996	1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenue	  $9,126,163 $7,851,007 $16,342,991 $14,516,102</p>
<p>Total Operating</p>
<p> Expenses	  1,355,531    570,581   2,950,719   1,395,513</p>
<p> Net Income	  377,916    409,795     452,679     517,822</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p> common share	   0.12	 0.19	  0.15	  0.23</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		     3,328,443  2,158,214   3,339,109   2,158,214</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the quarter was $377,916, or $0.12 per share, and was impacted by a charge to operations of $122,819 for expenses associated with the company's new Business Center.</p>
